<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <!--
    Shared test-support library (S08-F-02 / M4 follow-up).

    Hosts the ONE canonical public-API signature builder used by every
    golden-snapshot freeze gate (SdkContractFreezeTests over Vouchfx.Sdk and
    SdkTestingContractFreezeTests over Vouchfx.Sdk.Testing).  Keeping a single
    implementation here means the two goldens are byte-comparable: both are
    emitted by the same canonicalisation, so a member that is frozen one way in
    one golden is frozen the same way in the other.

    It also hosts the other pieces that would otherwise be duplicated across test
    assemblies: TestCertificateAuthority / TestCertificateStoreGuard (the mTLS
    certificate bed) and ChildProcess.KillTreeQuietly (the guarded tree-kill every
    child-process launch site calls from its `finally`, lifted here by #475 once a
    second assembly needed it).

    The standing constraint is BCL-only: nothing here references any Vouchfx.* type,
    so this project carries no ProjectReferences and can be referenced by any test
    assembly without creating a cycle.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <IsPackable>false</IsPackable>
  </PropertyGroup>

</Project>
